Keep the rust_helper_from_kuid export from being trimmed

With USER_NS=y no module of this build uses rust_helper_from_kuid any
more, so TRIM_UNUSED_KSYMS would drop its export. Listing it in the KMI
symbol list keeps it exported for the stock rust_binder.ko.

diff --git a/gki/aarch64/symbols/base b/gki/aarch64/symbols/base
index bdae957..0e62c7a 100644
--- a/gki/aarch64/symbols/base
+++ b/gki/aarch64/symbols/base
@@ -3,3 +3,6 @@
   module_layout
   __put_task_struct
   utf8_data_table
+
+# kept exported for the stock rust_binder.ko when CONFIG_USER_NS=y
+  rust_helper_from_kuid
